for purchasing arms. An AI system combining geospatial predictive or place-based policing information and Automated Number Plate Registration (ANPR) information of vehicles belonging to the suspects supports the human assessment in the investigation based on verifiable and objective facts directly linked to a specific criminal activity.", "type": "Document"}}